            },
            "description": {
              "value": "When you use Shield Block, you can create a flash of brilliant, multicolored light in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in the area must attempt a Fortitude save, with the following effects.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\nFailure: The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 minute. The creature can spend an Interact action rubbing its eyes to end this blinded condition.\nCritical Failure: The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 hour."
            }
          }
        }
